      "codeName": "D0",
      "capabilities": [
        "analog_input",
        "digital_input",
        "digital_output",
        "pwm_output"
      ],
      "notes": "BAT_MEASURE / MSR — battery-voltage sense (A0/D0). Short the MSR pads on the rear of the board to connect an onboard resistor divider (~1.585x) ahead of this pin so it reads the LiPo/Li-ion battery voltage (BAT+, ~2.7-4.2V) scaled into the ADC's 0-3.3V range; leave MSR open to use this pin as a plain ADC/GPIO."
    },
    {
