      ],
      "notes": "LED_BUILTIN — CONFIRMED onboard status LED (learn.pcbcupid.com pinouts/overview/blink-led pages, plus Adafruit CircuitPython's board definition for this exact board). Drive polarity could not be confirmed by any source (no schematic/inversion/active-state documentation found) so no led_high/led_low tag is applied — see pfodWeb NOTE above and boardsDetails/esp32/esp32c3/Pcbcupid_GLYPH_C3/notes.txt."
